      "title": "Deployment decisions (ADR-0013/0014/0015)",
      "items": [
        "Deployment target: on-prem for now (container platform) — revisit if that changes; the shape stays portable",
        "LLM is self-hosted, in-tenant, model treated as a swappable black box — candidates already available on-prem: Qwen Coder, gpt-oss-120b",
